# Caps for tool/check_ui_strings.sh --strict. LOWER after each wave; never raise.
# Wave "design tokens": raw colors 396 -> 120 (406 actually present before the wave).
# (2.0 feature-flags wave: +1 GlassContainer file, +1 gradient file each for the
# admin screen and the ComingSoon placeholder.)
# Audit wave: removed the orphan update_page screen + dead files (raw 97 -> 92)
# and tokenized 25 pre-revamp brand-hex occurrences (cyan/purple/pink).
# Copy wave: integration tests now assert AppStrings.* instead of re-typing the
# literal (goals/challenges, save-changes, edit-profile), so unique
# find.text('...') literals dropped 99 -> 95. Lower with it.
CAP_RAW_COLORS=92
CAP_GLASS_FILES=28
CAP_GRADIENT_FILES=57
CAP_BACKDROP_SITES=6
CAP_INTEG_LITERALS=95
# Localization wave: new counter. Baseline is the current debt (135 unique
# literal Text() args across Screens/Components). Migrating a screen to the ARB
# must lower this in the same change.
CAP_HARDCODED_SCREENS=135
